# The assessment of AGT-009 against this build. The requirement identifier is this
# file's stem and appears nowhere inside it, because a second place to spell the identity
# is a second place for it to be wrong -- the rule OD-SPEC-007 chose for a record
# registration, and CHK-003.assessment states for this registry.
#
# AGT-009: "KnowledgeWorkbench-assisted composition shall never create, remove, pass, fail,
# suppress, waive, reprioritize, or change the severity or blocking disposition of a Nomos
# finding. Any normative policy change shall proceed through the governed RulePackage
# calibration, review, versioning, publication, and rollout lifecycle."
#
# AGT-009's substance is Nomos's own governance of finding disposition, not KWB's knowledge
# domain, so the whole requirement stays assessable rather than NotBinding.
#
# The 'shall never mutate a finding' half is already structurally true by omission: `Finding`
# carries no severity field at all (disposition derives only from `gate`/`applicability`, set
# once by the producing rule), and the only real mechanisms that change a finding's blocking
# disposition -- `SuppressionPolicy`, `AdoptionPolicy`, `BaselineDebt` -- require an authored
# rationale/owner matched by rule/subject identity, with no composition path (KWB-driven or
# otherwise) into any of them; by each type's own doc comment, no caller constructs one yet.
#
# The second half -- normative policy changes proceeding through a governed RulePackage
# lifecycle -- is a genuine, real gap, narrower than it was: `nomos-rule-package` (`OD-
# PACKAGE-008`) now gives `PackageKind::RulePackage` a manifest type and a JSON reader, so it
# is no longer among the "genuinely unconsumed" kinds `PackageKind`'s own doc comment now
# lists -- but nothing outside that one crate calls the reader, and no code anywhere
# implements calibration, review, versioning, publication, or rollout for what it reads.
verdict: Partial
site: crates/contracts/nomos-contracts/src/reporting/finding.rs#Finding
site: crates/orchestration/nomos-gate-orchestration/src/policy/suppression_disposition/suppression_policy.rs#SuppressionPolicy
site: crates/orchestration/nomos-gate-orchestration/src/policy/rule_calibration/adoption_policy.rs#AdoptionPolicy
site: crates/orchestration/nomos-gate-orchestration/src/policy/baseline_debt.rs#BaselineDebt
gap: crates/contracts/nomos-contracts/src/package_kind.rs#RulePackage
